     2809   run v-c-2 in this-procedure .
     2810   END.
     2811   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF SelectObject IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2812   DO:
     2813     Assign SelectObject.
     2814   run select-objects-proc in this-procedure (input e-method).
     2815   END.
     2816   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF t-rv IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
