     2818     DO:   assign frame Dialog-Frame   t-rv .   display t-rv  with FRAME Dialog-Frame  .  END.
     2819   END.
     2820   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF t-rvc IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2821   DO:
     2822     DO:   assign frame Dialog-Frame   t-rvc .   display t-rvc  with FRAME Dialog-Frame  .  END.
     2823   END.
     2824   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF t-rvz IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2825   DO:
