     2828   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF T-rvzc IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2829   DO:
     2830     DO:   assign frame Dialog-Frame   T-rvzc .   display T-rvzc  with FRAME Dialog-Frame  .  END.
     2831   END.
     2832   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF T-sp IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2833   DO:
     2834     DO:   assign frame Dialog-Frame   T-sp .   display T-sp  with FRAME Dialog-Frame  .  END.
     2835   END.
     2836   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF T-sppv-2 IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2837   DO:
     2838     DO:   assign frame Dialog-Frame   T-sppv-2 .   display T-sppv-2  with FRAME Dialog-Frame  .  END.
     2839   END.
     2840   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF t-sppv-3 IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2841   DO:
     2842     DO:   assign frame Dialog-Frame   t-sppv-3 .   display t-sppv-3  with FRAME Dialog-Frame  .  END.
     2843   END.
     2844   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF T-sppv-4 IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
